      "created_at": "2026-02-26T15:23:55.154Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Can someone guide me on how to create a custom naming series where the item code is automatically created with the first 3 letters of my custom manufacturer field, first 3 letters of item group and the standard incremental counter?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c4cdca/{size}.png",
